  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{r}}=\\mathrm{k}(\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{b}}+\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{c}}) \\\\ & \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{r}} \\cdot \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{a}}=3 \\\\ & \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{r}} \\cdot \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{a}}=\\mathrm{k}(\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{b}} \\cdot \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{a}}+\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{c}} \\cdot \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{a}}) \\\\ & 3=\\mathrm{k}(2+6-15+3-2+3 \\lambda)\\end{aligned}$\n$3=\\mathrm{k}(-6+3 \\lambda)$   ...(1)\n$\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{r}}=\\mathrm{k}(5 \\hat{\\mathrm{i}}+2 \\hat{\\mathrm{j}}-(5-\\lambda) \\hat{\\mathrm{k}})$\n$|\\vec{r}|=k \\sqrt{25+4+25+\\lambda^2-10 \\lambda}=1$   ...(2)\n$\\mathrm{k}=\\frac{3}{-6+3 \\lambda}=\\frac{1}{-2+\\lambda} \\quad$ put in (2)\n$\\begin{aligned} & 4+\\lambda^2-4 \\lambda=54+\\lambda^2-10 \\lambda \\\\ & 6 \\lambda=50 \\\\ & 3 \\lambda=25\\end{aligned}$",
